# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Government Resolution No. 240
#   Approving submission of Cybersecurity Law Arts. 2, 11, 12,
#   13, 19, 23, 28, 30, 31, 38 and Annex 2 amendment to Seimas
#   (later enacted as XV-1076)
#   2026-04-08, Vilnius
#   Acting PM Kristupas Vaitiekūnas (Finance Minister)
# =================================================================

lld:GovRes-240-2026 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 240 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law amendment (definitions, thresholds, competence community) to Seimas (2026)" ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 240 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law amendment (definitions, thresholds, competence community) to Seimas (2026)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Vyriausybės nutarimas Nr. 240 – Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo pakeitimo (apibrėžtys, ribos, kompetencijų bendruomenė) teikimas Seimui (2026)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas the draft law amending Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 Arts. 2, 11, 12, 13, 19, 23, 28, 30, 31, 38 and Annex 2 (later enacted as XV-1076 on 2026-06-25). Adds root name server definition, refines essential/important subject identification thresholds, restructures competence community governance, expands manufacturing annex. Delegates Defence Minister Robertas Kaunas (deputies: Vice-Minister Tomas Godliauskas, Vice-Minister Karolis Aleksa) to represent Government in Seimas. Acting PM: Finance Minister Kristupas Vaitiekūnas." ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas the draft law amending Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 Arts. 2, 11, 12, 13, 19, 23, 28, 30, 31, 38 and Annex 2 (later enacted as XV-1076 on 2026-06-25). Adds root name server definition, refines essential/important subject identification thresholds, restructures competence community governance, expands manufacturing annex. Delegates Defence Minister Robertas Kaunas (deputies: Vice-Minister Tomas Godliauskas, Vice-Minister Karolis Aleksa) to represent Government in Seimas. Acting PM: Finance Minister Kristupas Vaitiekūnas."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Vyriausybė pritaria ir teikia Seimui Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo Nr. XII-1428 2, 11, 12, 13, 19, 23, 28, 30, 31, 38 straipsnių ir antro priedo pakeitimo įstatymo projektą (vėliau priimtas kaip XV-1076, 2026-06-25). Prideda šakninio vardų serverio apibrėžtį, tikslina esminio/svarbaus subjekto identifikavimo ribas, pertvarko kompetencijų bendruomenės valdymą, praplečia gamybos priedą. Įgalioja krašto apsaugos ministrą Robertą Kauną atstovauti Seime. Laikinai einantis Ministro Pirmininko pareigas: finansų ministras Kristupas Vaitiekūnas."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. 240" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2026-04-08"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true .
